## 📋 Part A — Intake Triage (the 5-minute front door)

*Anyone proposing an AI use case fills this in.*

| # | Question | Type |
|---|----------|------|
| A1 | Use case name & one-line description | Text |
| A2 | Requesting team & business sponsor | Text |
| A3 | What problem does this solve? What's the alternative today? | Text |
| A4 | Build, buy, or use a third-party GenAI service? | Choice |
| A5 | Does it use personal data? (none / internal staff / customers / special-category) | Choice |
| A6 | Does it make or influence a decision *about a person*? | Yes/No |
| A7 | Is the domain in EU AI Act Annex III (employment, credit, biometrics, essential services, law enforcement, education, migration)? | Yes/No |
| A8 | Is there a human reviewing outputs before they take effect? | Yes/No |
| A9 | Roughly how many people are affected, and how reversible is a wrong output? | Text |

**Routing:** Any Yes on A6/A7, "special-category" on A5, or "No" on A8 → **Tier 1 (Full AIA)**. Otherwise the lead assigns Tier 2 or 3.

