## 🗺️ Framework Mapping

| AIA Element | ISO 42001 | EU AI Act | NIST AI RMF |
|-------------|-----------|-----------|-------------|
| Intake triage / tiering | Clause 6.1 (risk-based) | Risk classification (Art. 6, Annex III) | *Map 1* |
| Full impact assessment | **Clause 6.1.2 + A.6.2** | Art. 27 (fundamental-rights impact assessment) | *Map 2, 3* |
| Data section | A.7 (data for AI) | Art. 10 (data governance) | *Map 4* |
| Human oversight | A.9.2 | Art. 14 (human oversight) | *Manage 1* |
| Decision gate + records | Clause 9 (evaluation) | Art. 11 & 18 (documentation, record-keeping) | *Govern 1.4* |

